# =============================================================================
# ChapMee — Docker build context exclusions
# Goal: smaller/faster context, no secrets, no rebuild of artifacts already
# produced inside the image. See footer for files that MUST reach the builder.
# =============================================================================

# --- Dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside image) ---
node_modules
.next
out
dist
build
coverage
.pnpm-store

# --- Version control & CI ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Secrets & env (never send to daemon) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Logs & debug ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.next-dev*
.next-start-*

# --- Docker / deploy metadata (not needed for `next build`) ---
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml
Caddyfile.production
vercel.json

# --- Docs & operator notes ---
README.md
docs
*.md

# --- Editor / IDE / OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
.editorconfig
.prettierrc
.prettierignore
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Local dev / agent / temp artifacts ---
.codex-tmp
.codex-screenshots
.auth-test-*.txt
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
eslint-one.json

# --- Large or local-only data ---
chapters.json
imports.json
backups
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# --- SQL / scratch files at repo root ---
tmp-*
_tmp_*

# --- DB migration trees (not imported by Next.js compile; run separately) ---
drizzle
db
drizzle.config.ts

# --- Deploy scripts & ops tooling (not used during image build) ---
deploy
scripts/**
!scripts/next-build.mjs

# =============================================================================
# MUST NOT be ignored (required for `pnpm|npm|yarn build`):
#   app/ components/ lib/ public/ src/ hooks/ styles/ types/
#   proxy.ts (Next.js middleware)
#   package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, package-lock.json, yarn.lock
#   pnpm-workspace.yaml, .npmrc
#   next.config.ts, next-env.d.ts, tsconfig.json
#   postcss.config.js, tailwind.config.ts, eslint.config.mjs
#   scripts/next-build.mjs
# =============================================================================
